## Layout rules (enforced by charter)

- **rules/** hard constraints — never violated without owner sign-off
- **practices/** how we build — commands, conventions
- **docs/** verified architecture and specs (current truth)
- **memory/** durable operational facts
- **learning/** append-only dated lessons log + distilled pitfalls
- **plans/** active work and handoffs — see the [status board](plans/README.md)
- **archive/** superseded material — history, never cite as current
- **agents/&lt;name&gt;/** per-agent wiring only — how each tool connects to this KB
